export anchor DominoesStyle:
    number: 103
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Dominoes
    idea: The dashboard laid out in ivory and black domino tiles, with every total spelled in pips, each project a long tile with a pip track for progress, and the fortnight stood up as a row of dominoes whose height is the day's count.
    base: light
    palette:
        tableIvory: #f3eee2, the page
        tileIvory: #fffaf0, ivory tiles, the header, panels and fields
        tileBlack: #161513, text, outlines, black tiles, pips on ivory and the primary button
        pipIvory: #fbf6ea, pips and text on black tiles
        feltGrey: #4a463d, captions, meta and axis labels
        spinnerBrass: #b08d3c, the centre spinner dot on summary tiles and the focus halo, never text
        bone: #ddd5c3, empty pip slots and tile lips
        green: #1f5f3e, On track
        amber: #865100, At risk
        red: #a3231b, Behind and overdue
    type:
        Avenir Next, Avenir, Montserrat, Segoe UI, sans-serif, at 700 with
        tabular figures for numbers and headings and 400 for text. The
        greeting is 30 to 44px, summary numbers 40px, tile percents 44px,
        project names 18px, body 15px and caps labels 11 to 13px tracked
        0.12 to 0.14em.
    layout:
        An ivory header with a 3px black base holds a small black domino
        logo and the brand, pill nav links with the current one black, a
        search field, the bell, a black New project pill and the user as a
        tiny two half domino with initials. The greeting sits left with a
        black overdue tile at right. The four totals are domino tiles that
        spell each number in pips, 0 and 6, 2 and 3, a black 0 and 4, and a
        three half 1, 8 and 6 tile, each above its numeral and label. The
        projects are long tiles in two columns, a left half with the big
        percent and a right half with name, meta, a track of ten pips filled
        for each tenth done and the status. The Behind project is turned to
        the black side. Below, the fortnight shows a standing domino per day,
        two pip columns tall with one pip per task, ivory for last week and
        black for this week, beside Line of play, a list with initial
        dominoes. Projects go one column below 1000px.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between tiles, 16 to 24px tile padding and 40px between sections.
    density: Medium. Two columns of long project tiles and a row of standing tiles.
    corners: 12px on tiles and panels, 5 to 6px on small dominoes, round pips, pill buttons and nav.
    borders: 3px black outlines with a 2px black or ivory centre line between halves.
    shadows: Tiles sit on a bone lip, 0 4px 0 #ddd5c3, plus a soft 0 8px 16px rgba(22,21,19,0.08) on project tiles.
    icons:
        Solid pips and simple shapes in currentColor. A round pip for On
        track, a diamond for At risk and a cross for Behind and overdue, each
        in an outlined pill with the word. People are tiny dominoes with an
        initial on each half.
    focus: A 3px black outline offset 3px inside a 7px brass halo.
    tone: Short and steady, such as Line of play and Ten pips per tile.
